      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      413.65,
      537.9,
      448.72
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 32 read with Section 22 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) asamended from time to time, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance, do by this declare that the rules set out heretoshall come into force on 01.04.2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      461.65,
      537.93,
      484.72
    ],
    "text": "The Excise Notification No. 972 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1885/44 of 24.10.2014 is herebyrescinded.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      494.05,
      532.03,
      553.12
    ],
    "text": "RAVI KARUNANAYAKE,Minister of Finance.Ministry of Finance,Colombo 01,02nd March 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      278.73,
      566.94,
      306.93,
      576.9
    ],
    "text": "RULES",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      590.05,
      537.88,
      613.12
    ],
    "text": "1. There shall be a imposed and charged excise duty on the articles specified in Column I and on the respectivequantities in the Column II at the rates specified in Column III of the Schedule I.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      626.05,
      538.01,
      649.12
    ],
    "text": "2. A person who wishes to import Ethyl alcohol shall submit an application form set out in accordance with theSchedule II to the Commissioner General of Excise.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      662.05,
      537.9,
      685.12
    ],
    "text": "3. If the Commissioner General of Excise is satisfied about the application forwarded by the applicant, theapproval shall be sent to the Controller of Imports and Exports with the form set out in accordance with the Schedule III.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
